      "statement": "Placebo transitions are constructed by exact matching on cohort, sector, and max_size, then sampling controls with probability p = MULTIPLE * N_treated / n_control where MULTIPLE = TARGET_N_CONTROL / MEAN (TARGET_N_CONTROL defaults to 10).",
